 with the combo. Name, price and prep are computed from the parts, not stored. Parts are typed Dish, not MenuItem, so a combo can't contain another combo. A Dish on the Menu is in no combo, hence 0..1 at the ComboMeal end.&lt;br&gt;Salad + Pasta: (2700 × 90 + 50) / 100 = 2430 cents ($24.30);&lt;br&gt;prep 1 + 2 = 3 units." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="165" width="380" y="778" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="74G5VmW_-uet4xG0v6QQ-56" edge="1" parent="1" source="74G5VmW_-uet4xG0v6QQ-55" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;rounded=0;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=default;" target="74G5VmW_-uet4xG0v6QQ-25" value=""><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="74G5VmW_-uet4xG0v6QQ-57" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=26;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#000000;" value="&lt;b&gt;Order&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="374" width="415" x="1270" y="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="74G5VmW_-uet4xG0v6QQ-58" parent="74G5VmW_-uet4xG0v6QQ-57" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;" value="- customer: Customer {readOnly}" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="20" width="415" y="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="74G5VmW_-uet4xG0v6QQ-59" parent="74G5VmW_-uet4xG0v6QQ-57" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;" value="- item: MenuItem {readOnly}" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="20" width="415" y="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell