UIJIanr12Hzwb-66" style="endArrow=open;endFill=0;endSize=10;dashed=1;html=1;rounded=0;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=default;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0;exitY=0.5952;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.0817;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="Q7gkc12UIJIanr12Hzwb-15" value="«use»"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Q7gkc12UIJIanr12Hzwb-103" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;Polymorphism: Customer subclasses&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;At turn end, the controller calls endTurn() on every queued or seated customer, without type checks. This final method holds the eating and waiting-loss rules once; only getWaitingLoss() differs (Regular 8, VIP 5, Critic 12). StandardPricing asks getPricePercent(), so a VIP pays 90% before Happy Hour's 20% off. The customer with id n orders menu item n, going back to item 1 after the last (combos included). CriticCustomer overrides chooseItem() to order the most expensive item (first if tied)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="158" width="300" x="2450" y="722" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="Q7gkc12UIJIanr12Hzwb-104" edge="1" parent="1" source="Q7gkc12UIJIanr12Hzwb-103" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;rounded=0;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=default;" target="Q7gkc12UIJIanr12Hzwb-15" value=""><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="CUfIJv78AHM_I6TLv2L7-4" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#FFFFFF);fontSize=11;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 12px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Default getPricePercent() = 100.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 12px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;VIPCustomer overrides it to return 90.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="50" width="220" x="3141.25" y="850" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="CUfIJv78AHM_I6TLv2L7-5" edge="1" parent="1" source="Q7gkc12UIJIanr12Hzwb-32" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;dashPattern=1 3;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;defaultLabelBackgroundColor=page;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" target="CUfIJv78AHM_I6TLv2L7-4" value=""><mxGeometry height="50" relative="1" width="50" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="2970" y="820" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="3020" y="770" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="CUfIJv78AHM_I6TLv2L7-6" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#FFFFFF);fontSize=11;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 12px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;Default: deterministic menu selection.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;CriticCustomer overrides chooseItem()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;to select the most expensive item&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;(first item in case of a tie).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="70" width="220" x="3141.25" y="740" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="CUfIJv78AHM_I6TLv2L7-7" edge="1" parent="1" source="Q7gkc12UIJIanr12Hzwb-31" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;dashPattern=1 3;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;defaultLabelBackgroundColor=page;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" target="CUfIJv78AHM_I6TLv2L7-6" value=""><mxGeometry height="50" relative="1" width="50" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="3060" y="740" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="3209" y="847" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="jWQYw8eMYrmVWEXQ9OoH-1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;dashed=1;dashPattern=10 6;strokeColor=#7f7f7f;strokeWidth=2;pointerEvents=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingTop=8;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#7f7f7f;" value="PART 3 – Control, Boundary &amp;amp; Integration" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="1248" width="1440" x="